[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 16682.47, "timestamp": "04:38:02", "text": "就像保险和印花税一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16684.31, "timestamp": "04:38:04", "text": "出国前请先办理护照"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16686.949, "timestamp": "04:38:06", "text": "为了工作。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16689.91, "timestamp": "04:38:09", "text": "所以这是一项额外的要求，而且是……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16694.39, "timestamp": "04:38:14", "text": "就好像这不是公开信息，或者说，这并非众所周知的事实。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16697.31, "timestamp": "04:38:17", "text": "至少周围的人都不知道。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16701.67, "timestamp": "04:38:21", "text": "我。所以，这算是新闻吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16707.109, "timestamp": "04:38:27", "text": "对我来说，就好像我从未听说过一样。所以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16711.19, "timestamp": "04:38:31", "text": "是啊，那确实很艰难。 M，即"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16712.67, "timestamp": "04:38:32", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16716.47, "timestamp": "04:38:36", "text": "美好的。那么，银行呢？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16720.269, "timestamp": "04:38:40", "text": "东西？你开银行账户了吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16724.029, "timestamp": "04:38:44", "text": "哦，银行账户。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16729.189, "timestamp": "04:38:49", "text": "呃，我的意思是，不。是的。我没带我的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16732.91, "timestamp": "04:38:52", "text": "我随身携带的卡，就像我的借记卡一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16736.629, "timestamp": "04:38:56", "text": "我刚刚在一家银行开了一个新的账户。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16739.99, "timestamp": "04:38:59", "text": "就像这里的邮局一样。呃，所以你"}]